Hello,

I've just upgraded my DEC Alpha Workstation 500 au from NetBSD 8.1 to 9.0, and
now I see some messages about unaligned access in the sshd process each time I
boot. Finally, sshd starts fine. I don't know if I must worry about it, if it
is under control, or if I must file a bug report (I'm a newbie in the NetBSD
world).

-- 
Francisco J. Tsao Santín
